putils", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "dbb4049f7021e20b75573daaeaa6a93720a3b63c", "message": "Updated iss to include missing quadmath dll for Win32.", "created_at": "2015-11-04T10:20:50Z", "repo": "dlputils", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "325ee0138b743554f9fdd6f7c5d7ec671a680137", "message": "Fixed - pdensgauss was broken (and adjusted normalisation again).", "created_at": "2015-10-23T10:08:56Z", "repo": "dlputils", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b380d688e9d179e493846683ba01a52fc9163675", "message": "Updated clusterab. Updated integerlist to accept ranges of numbers using N-M syntax.", "created_at": "2015-10-19T14:46:46Z", "repo": "dlputils", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3b5b3010ea8a8cd681c25db1bc81e1e659f2322c", "message": "Renamed filterdlp to dlpfilter.", "created_at": "2015-10-16T13:53:22Z", "repo": "dlputils", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4bf4f2fcaffe8ad225458d2320b85c251f058e15", "message": "Updated integerlist parsing to accept an 'x' to stop parsing, thus allowing empty lists to be given. Updated filterdlp.", "created_at": "2015-10-16T13:52:10Z", "repo": "dlputils", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7050b0eed88fac6c639f5e796c4a5f3ef6c31fd8", "message": "Version bump to 1.4.2.", "created_at": "2015-09-03T14:11:57Z", "repo": "dlputils", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ec852373663be6ba3ad7d9e62f1043a74b9a38be", "message": "Fixed geom, which was segfaulting before doing anything useful. Updated rdf to use new parse routines.", "created_at": "2015-09-03T13:46:22Z", "repo": "dlputils", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e60258d828208a4579429e10a9b53f4e023e8eb7", "message": "Removed debug output from ringconf.", "created_at": "2015-08-25T13:49:44Z", "repo": "dlputils", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4cca04874d3c07b39be6203c099a4e345f7ecdaa", "message": "Reorganised utility functions a little, and added routine to generate output filename based on input base filename and extension. Updated ringconf, which now writes full and normalised (d=1.0) pdens files of conformer data. Updated formated of saved pdens files in pdensrw, giving more decimals and exponential format to grid origin data.", "created_at": "2015-08-25T12:42:35Z", "repo": "dlputils", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b6c3819d4a206014cd0f3fa78e5944d576eccb4c", "message": "Changed pdens to bin offset values in grid when using -origin.", "created_at": "2015-08-21T15:39:49Z", "repo": "dlputils", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5879f6fc2eeddeabc64d6b7b038eaec5b2699d05", "message": "Loop order in pdensrw now refers to fastest varying dimension first, for compatibility with Aten. Fixed - pdenstrim was not correctly writing blank lines in gnuplot mode.", "created_at": "2015-08-18T14:06:08Z", "repo": "dlputils", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5b10d6cbf3e8486194ccd1fe1d95fdd1dd4f1d6b", "message": "Adjusted read/write of pdens files to make loop order consistent with non-cubic grids.", "created_at": "2015-08-17T15:45:15Z", "repo": "dlputils", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d0aa6181cb5bbadef600264b4a18555455f4f546", "message": "When using -origin option in pdens, grid is constructed from offset coordinates, with non-offset average molecule written out as in previous versions. Added coordination number and angle bin marker output to ardf. Updated pdensrw to allocate arrays based on min/max values for each direction, and save out compatible data with grid extents also stored. Updated pdens, pdenstrim, pdensgauss, and pdensint to use new grid limit specification. Added pdensinfo to provide quick summary of contents of pdens file.", "created_at": "2015-08-17T15:03:43Z", "repo": "dlputils", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1128cf1f3aac27932b0429a9ed573d1d51044dd8", "message": "Fixed - reallist.f90 was broken, and integerlist.f90 did not accept negative numbers as input.", "created_at": "2015-08-17T12:16:51Z", "repo": "dlputils", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "894a74e934de8703cc34543531a38aca1b6da406", "message": "Removed old glucsphere-test dir, and old make script.", "created_at": "2015-08-14T15:22:42Z", "repo": "dlputils", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}], "prs": [{"created_at": "2024-07-24T09:59:43Z", "body_length": 89}, {"created_at": "2023-06-25T18:08:19Z", "body_length": 0}, {"created_at": "2023-06-25T18:03:46Z", "body_length": 0}, {"created_at": "2023-06-25T18:03:39Z", "body_length": 0}, {"created_at": "2023-06-25T17:42:45Z", "body_length": 0}, {"created_at": "2023-06-23T14:57:51Z", "body_length": 0}, {"created_at": "2023-06-23T09:13:04Z", "body_length": 580}]}